OL,3,GNEWSAChicken droppings gas plant
OL,4,Aproposal to be decided
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn application to build a biogas plant
OL,7,Ffuelled by chicken droppings will be
OL,8,Fdecided next week.
OL,10,FIf approved, the site on the outskirts
OL,11,Fof Anwick, near Sleaford, Lincolnshire,
OL,12,Fwould process 120,000 tonnes of faeces
OL,13,Fand feedstock waste to produce gas
OL,14,Fpumped into the National Grid.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
