OL,3,GNEWSAChicken droppings gas plant
OL,4,Aproposal to be decided
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn action group that has previously
OL,7,Fsaid it would "kill the village" has
OL,8,Fset up a petition signed by more than
OL,9,F600 people, but developer Stream
OL,10,FBioenergy said the project would be "a
OL,11,Fstate-of-the-art development with a
OL,12,Frobust multi-stage odour control
OL,13,Fsystem".
OL,15,FThe plans went before Lincolnshire
OL,16,FCounty Council's planning committee in
OL,17,FMay, but they were withdrawn before a
OL,18,Ffinal decision was made.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
